adokawa Shoten"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"From the depths of space he is coming...\n\nAncient beyond understanding, his power is immeasurable. He has destroyed half the universe and is on his way here. He is... Genma.\n\nOnly two people are aware of the imminent catastrophe: Princess Luna, a modern day prophetess and Vega, a cybernetic crusader from a world long since ravaged by Genma. Determined to spare the Earth from a similar fate, Luna and Vega must try to mobilize the most potent psychics in the world. Together, this army of fledging psychic warriors must succeed where billions have tried... and failed.\n\nBut will they be able to gather their champions in time? Genma's agents are already on Earth to ensure that their master meets with no opposition!\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Power","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cosmic Horror","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Environmental","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Space","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":30,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Harmagedon","english":"Harmagedon","native":"幻魔大戦","romaji":"Genma Taisen","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"幻魔大战"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}